{"seq":2,"slug":"utm-systems","title":"无人机交通管理系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/low-altitude-technology/airspace-management/utm-systems","wordCount":1580,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"无人机交通管理系统\">无人机交通管理系统</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>当数千架无人机同时在城市上空运行时，传统的&quot;一对一&quot;空中交通管制模式将彻底失效——一个管制员不可能同时指挥上百架自动化飞行器。无人机交通管理（UTM, UAS Traffic Management）应运而生，它是一套面向高密度、低空、无人驾驶航空器的自动化交通管理架构，是低空经济规模化运营的&quot;操作系统&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-utm-概念架构\">1 UTM 概念架构</h3><p>UTM 的核心设计哲学：<strong>高度自动化、服务导向、联邦分布式</strong>。</p>\n<p>NASA 提出的 UTM 四阶段技术成熟度（TCL）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>运行环境</th>\n<th>密度</th>\n<th>核心能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TCL-1</td>\n<td>农村/隔离</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>通知、地理围栏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TCL-2</td>\n<td>人口稀疏</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>超视距、冲突咨询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TCL-3</td>\n<td>城郊</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>间隔管理、DAA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TCL-4</td>\n<td>城市密集</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>大规模自动化管理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>中国 UOMS（UAS Operation Management System）参照此框架，增加了&quot;实名登记-适飞查询-计划审批-监视追踪-应急处置&quot;全链路管理。</p>\n<h3 id=\"2-utm-核心服务\">2 UTM 核心服务</h3><p>一个完整的 UTM 系统提供以下服务栈：</p>\n<p><strong>基础服务层</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>注册服务（Registry）：飞行器/操作员实名登记</li>\n<li>远程识别（Remote ID）：飞行中持续广播身份和位置（ASTM F3411 标准）</li>\n<li>飞行授权（Flight Authorization）：计划提交-冲突检测-自动/人工审批</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>战略服务层</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>战略冲突管理（Strategic Deconfliction）：提前发现 4D 轨迹冲突</li>\n<li>动态空域管理（Dynamic Airspace Management）：实时调整空域状态</li>\n<li>容量管理（Demand-Capacity Balancing）：预测拥堵并实施流量措施</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>战术服务层</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>冲突探测与解脱（CD&amp;R）：实时间隔保持</li>\n<li>应急管理（Emergency Management）：故障/偏航/入侵响应</li>\n<li>协同间隔（Collaborative Separation）：多 USS 间的间隔协调</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"3-技术架构与数据流\">3 技术架构与数据流</h3><p>UTM 的分布式架构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"运营商 A ──→ USS-A ──┐&#10;运营商 B ──→ USS-B ──┼──→ FIMS ──→ ATC 系统&#10;运营商 C ──→ USS-C ──┘         ↕&#10;                              SDSP（补充数据服务）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>运营商 A ──→ USS-A ──┐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>运营商 B ──→ USS-B ──┼──→ FIMS ──→ ATC 系统</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>运营商 C ──→ USS-C ──┘         ↕</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                              SDSP（补充数据服务）</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li><strong>USS（UAS Service Supplier）</strong>：面向运营商提供服务的商业实体（类似通信运营商）</li>\n<li><strong>FIMS（Flight Information Management System）</strong>：政府级核心网关，连接 USS 与传统 ATC</li>\n<li><strong>SDSP（Supplemental Data Service Provider）</strong>：提供气象、地形、障碍物等补充数据</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关键数据流与接口：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>USS↔USS：通过标准 API 交换飞行意图和位置（网状互联）</li>\n<li>USS→FIMS：飞行计划提交、合规报告</li>\n<li>FIMS→USS：空域限制、NOTAM、应急指令</li>\n<li>飞行器→USS：遥测数据（位置/速度/状态）上报，频率 1–10 Hz</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"4-冲突检测与解脱算法\">4 冲突检测与解脱算法</h3><p>战略冲突检测（提前数分钟到数小时）：</p>\n<p>给定两条 4D 轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">T</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{T}_A(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">T</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{T}_B(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，冲突条件：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">T</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">T</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\exists t \\in [t_0, t_f]: \\|\\mathbf{T}_A(t) - \\mathbf{T}_B(t)\\| &lt; d_{min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∃</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为最小间隔标准（水平 30–100 m，垂直 15–30 m，视空域类别而定）。</p>\n<p><strong>解脱策略优先级</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>时间解脱：调整出发时间（成本最低）</li>\n<li>垂直解脱：改变巡航高度层</li>\n<li>水平解脱：改变航路（成本最高）</li>\n<li>地面等待：拥堵时段延迟起飞</li>\n</ol>\n<p>战术冲突解脱（实时，&lt; 60 s 预测窗口）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>基于速度障碍（VO, Velocity Obstacle）的规避：计算碰撞锥，选择锥外速度</li>\n<li>ORCA（Optimal Reciprocal Collision Avoidance）：分布式协商，每方承担一半规避责任</li>\n<li>垂直规避优先：城市环境中水平机动空间受限，垂直爬升/下降更安全</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"5-remote-id-与网络监视\">5 Remote ID 与网络监视</h3><p>远程识别是 UTM 的&quot;身份证系统&quot;：</p>\n<p><strong>广播式 Remote ID</strong>：飞行器通过 Bluetooth 5.0 / Wi-Fi NaN 广播：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>UAS ID（序列号或会话 ID）</li>\n<li>位置（经纬高）、速度、航向</li>\n<li>操作员位置</li>\n<li>时间戳</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>网络式 Remote ID</strong>：通过蜂窝网络将遥测上报至 USS，第三方通过 USS API 查询。</p>\n<p>两种模式对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>广播式</th>\n<th>网络式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>覆盖范围</td>\n<td>300–1000 m（视RF）</td>\n<td>全球（有蜂窝覆盖）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>&lt; 1 s</td>\n<td>1–5 s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隐私</td>\n<td>任何人可接收</td>\n<td>受控查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本</td>\n<td>低（内置芯片）</td>\n<td>需数据流量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>执法/安防</td>\n<td>交通管理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"6-utm-与传统-atm-的融合\">6 UTM 与传统 ATM 的融合</h3><p>长期目标是实现 UTM-ATM 无缝融合（Unified Traffic Management）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>信息共享</strong>：UTM 向 ATM 通报低空活动，ATM 向 UTM 下发管制空域变更</li>\n<li><strong>动态空域边界</strong>：根据流量需求实时调整 UTM/ATM 管辖界面</li>\n<li><strong>异构交通混合</strong>：eVTOL（类似有人航空器）可能同时使用 UTM 和 ATM 服务</li>\n<li><strong>统一冲突管理</strong>：跨系统的间隔标准和优先级规则</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这一融合预计在 2030 年前后实现初步能力（中国规划为&quot;低空智联网三期工程&quot;）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2025年，中国多个城市的 UTM 平台进入实战阶段：深圳&quot;天路&quot;系统日均管理超过 2000 架次物流无人机运行；杭州亚运遗产系统升级为城市级 UTM。技术前沿方面，区块链被引入 UTM 用于不可篡改的飞行记录和去中心化身份验证；数字孪生技术实现&quot;先仿真后放飞&quot;的运行验证模式；AI 预测模型将冲突探测提前量从分钟级提升到 10 分钟以上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>设计一个简化的 USS-USS 冲突检测协议：两个 USS 各管理 100 架无人机，如何高效判断跨 USS 冲突？分析通信复杂度。</li>\n<li>给定一条直线航路和一个动态禁区（以某点为圆心、半径随时间变化），推导飞行器的最优时间解脱策略。</li>\n<li>比较广播式和网络式 Remote ID 在&quot;城市物流配送&quot;场景下的优缺点，提出混合方案。</li>\n<li>UTM 系统的单点故障分析：如果 FIMS 宕机 5 分钟，各 USS 应如何保证安全运行？设计降级策略。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>UTM 是低空经济的&quot;神经系统&quot;——没有高效的交通管理，大规模无人机运行将陷入混乱。从 USS 服务架构到冲突检测算法，从 Remote ID 到 ATM 融合，UTM 的设计融合了航空安全理念与互联网分布式架构。理解 UTM 不仅需要航空背景，还需要软件工程、分布式系统和通信网络的跨学科知识——这正是低空技术作为&quot;新工科&quot;交叉学科的典型体现。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"无人机交通管理系统","id":"无人机交通管理系统"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"1 UTM 概念架构","id":"1-utm-概念架构"},{"level":3,"text":"2 UTM 核心服务","id":"2-utm-核心服务"},{"level":3,"text":"3 技术架构与数据流","id":"3-技术架构与数据流"},{"level":3,"text":"4 冲突检测与解脱算法","id":"4-冲突检测与解脱算法"},{"level":3,"text":"5 Remote ID 与网络监视","id":"5-remote-id-与网络监视"},{"level":3,"text":"6 UTM 与传统 ATM 的融合","id":"6-utm-与传统-atm-的融合"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"低空空域管理体系","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/low-altitude-technology/airspace-management/low-altitude-airspace"},"next":{"title":"适航审定与法规体系","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/low-altitude-technology/airspace-management/airworthiness-regulations"}}